          "prompt": "A recipe uses 2/3 cup of oats and 3/4 cup of fruit. How many cups are used altogether?",
          "workedSolution": {
            "steps": [
              "“Altogether” calls for addition: 2/3 + 3/4.",
              "Use twelfths and add: 8/12 + 9/12 = 17/12.",
              "Rewrite 17/12 as 1 5/12 cups."
